THE BUILD IS DETERMINISTIC, WHICH IS WHAT MAKES THE DELTA ATTRIBUTABLE:
  Rebuilding HEAD's own pyproject.toml (`git show HEAD:pyproject.toml` into /tmp/oldb, same builder):
    95,902 B   25 files / 265,052 B   sha256 0a09390662ab22bb2499338cd23c2f1cd6e1f66c2d9f487b30ad22895fed7537
